# The legacy-assets output as the mapping set produced it before the model
# and mapping changes seeded for CT-29 to CT-35 -- the expectation CT-38
# compares the current run against.
#
# Regenerated deliberately, never automatically. A golden file that updates
# itself records whatever happened rather than what was agreed, and answers
# "did this change?" with "no" every time.

@prefix gist: <https://w3id.org/semanticarts/ns/ontology/gist/> .
@prefix : <https://example.org/water/model#> .
@prefix vocab: <https://example.org/water/vocab#> .
<https://example.org/water/data/asset-A2> a :Reading ;
	gist:isCategorizedBy vocab:Resevoir ;
	gist:numericValue "88.0" .
<https://example.org/water/data/asset-A1> a :Reading ;
	gist:isCategorizedBy vocab:Resevoir ;
	gist:numericValue "120.5" .
